        "original_id": "e9f5150f-a179-561f-8c61-4733a06314ea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rolf de Heer, Joseph M. Newman, Damon Gameau\n- Works: The Tracker, This Island Earth, Love My Way, How I Met Your Mother\n- Roles: film director, writer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph M. Newman was born on August 17, 1909, and he was an American film director.\n- Rolf de Heer was born on 4 May 1951, and he is a Dutch Australian film director.\n- Joseph M. Newman was most famous for directing the 1955 film \"This Island Earth.\"\n- The film \"The Tracker\" was directed and written by Rolf de Heer.\n- Damon Gameau appeared in the 2002 Australian film \"The Tracker.\"\n- Damon Gameau also appeared in the Australian series \"Love My Way\" and in a small role in the US series \"How I Met Your Mother.\"\n- Joseph M. Newman died on January 23, 2006.",
